# 🔍 Saffron & Sage — Complete Project Audit Report

## A. Current Architecture

| Layer | Technology | Notes |
|-------|-----------|-------|
| Frontend | React 18 + Vite + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS 3 | SPA with client-side routing |
| Backend | Supabase (PostgreSQL + Auth + Storage + Edge Functions + Realtime) | BaaS — no custom backend server |
| Auth | Supabase Auth (email/password, Google OAuth, email verification) | Client-side SDK |
| Payments | Razorpay (order created server-side via edge function) | Secure amount verification |
| Maps | Leaflet + OpenStreetMap Nominatim | No API key needed |
| Hosting | Static SPA (Vite build) | No Docker/CI config found |

### Key Insight
This is a **frontend-only** application backed by Supabase. There is no custom backend server, no Express/Node API, no Docker files, no CI/CD config. Rate limiting and server-side validation must be enforced through **Supabase RLS policies**, **Edge Functions**, and **frontend hardening**.

